Taking your first step in AI
    1. Get friends to learn about AI with you
        - Courses
        - Reading group
    2. Start brainstorming projects
        - No project is too small
    3. Hire a few ML/DS people to help
        - In addition to adding AI training 
    4. Hire or appoint an AI leader (VP AI, CAIO, etc.)
    5. Discuss with CEO/Board possibilities of AI Transformation
        - Will your company be much more valuable and/or effective if it were good at AI?
        
